mockingbird is an independent Go reimplementation of Castle Mock
(https://github.com/castlemock/castlemock), which is archived and no longer
maintained. Parts of mockingbird (mock matching semantics, the response
expression grammar and functions, the CastleMock data-dir/export formats and
test cases derived from them) were ported from Castle Mock's source code.

